**Step 9 — Run regression tests:** Rerun relevant automated tests and end-to-end journeys.

**Step 10 — Report:** Provide actual changes, results, limitations, and deployment instructions.

Do not stop after the audit or initial plan. Implement safe fixes and verify them.

